From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucaszhongsj <lucaszhongsj@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:58:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] games: a profile forwards the 3D layout's unclaimed touches

A game whose touch screen the 3D layout must reach sets touch_forward on,
and five more titles guess their profile from the RomFS.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: a game whose touch screen the 3D layout must reach turns touch_forward on, and five more titles guess their profile
Issue: none yet: no upstream issue for the touch forward

